   "Switch on means logged in, off means logged out (cached locally). While logged out, tapping “{loginTabs}” shows the login screen first, then switches to that tab after logging in; while logged in, it switches right away.": "打开开关表示已登录，关闭表示未登录（已缓存到本地）。未登录时点击「{loginTabs}」会先弹出登录页，登录后自动切换到该 Tab；已登录时直接切换。",
   "Switch tab icon": "切换 Tab 图标",
   "Tab Bar Gallery": "TabBar 场景展示",
   "Tab bar appearance": "TabBar 外观",
