   "Tab pages, selection and login": "Tab 页面、选中与登录",
   "Tab tap animation (issue #535)": "Tab 点击动画（issue #535）",
   "Tab tap sound and haptics (issue #535)": "Tab 点击声音与触感反馈（issue #535）",
   "Tap the arrows on the right to call cyl_switchToAdjacentTabWithStep:-1 / 1. Like a swipe, it skips the PlusButton and checks login. Last result: {adjacent}": "点击右侧箭头调用 cyl_switchToAdjacentTabWithStep:-1 / 1，与滑动相同会跳过 PlusButton 并检查登录。上次返回：{adjacent}",
   "Tap to change the language": "点击切换语言",
   "Tap to change the scroll behavior. Now: {scrollBehavior}. Liquid Glass (iOS 26+): the system minimizes the TabBar; FlatDesign and the classic style (iOS 25 and earlier, iOS 26 UI compatibility mode): the TabBar hides.": "点击切换滚动行为。当前：{scrollBehavior}。液态玻璃（iOS 26+）由系统缩小 TabBar；扁平样式与经典样式（iOS 25 及以前、iOS 26 UI 兼容模式）隐藏 TabBar。",
   "Tap to open a system UITabBarController: tap a tab or drag the page left or right, and the page slides with your finger.": "点击打开一个系统 UITabBarController：点击 Tab 或在页面上左右拖动，页面跟随手指滑动切换。",
   "Tap to pick a case and push a tab bar controller: its PlusButton has no image at first; 2 seconds later the image is loaded, replaced or removed, or a background image is loaded. The result should match an image set at launch.": "点击选择场景，push 一个 TabBarController：PlusButton 创建时没有图片，2 秒后加载、替换、移除图片或加载背景图片；最终布局应与启动时就有图片一致。",
   "Tap to pick a theme: the TabBar background, icons and text colors change in place, in every TabBar style. Now: {skin}": "点击选择主题：TabBar 的背景、图标与文字颜色原地切换，所有 TabBar 样式均适用。当前：{skin}",
   "Tap to run: cyl_setWeakAssociatedObject:forKey: returns nil once the object is released; cyl_nearestControlBelowView: finds the selected tab's button from its icon.": "点击运行：cyl_setWeakAssociatedObject:forKey: 在对象释放后返回 nil；cyl_nearestControlBelowView: 从选中 Tab 的图标找到它的按钮。",
   "Tap to select the next tab. Index without the PlusButton: {indexWithoutPlus}, selectedIndex: {selectedIndex}, now: {selectedTitle}": "点击切换到下一个 Tab。不含加号按钮的下标：{indexWithoutPlus}，selectedIndex：{selectedIndex}，当前：{selectedTitle}",
   "Tap to switch tabBar.standardAppearance, current: {appearance}": "点击切换 tabBar.standardAppearance，当前：{appearance}",
   "Tap to switch the tap animation of the tabs and the PlusButton. Now: {tapAnimation}": "点击切换 Tab 与加号按钮的点击动画，当前：{tapAnimation}",
   "Tap to switch the vertical offset of all tab titles, current: {titleOffset}": "点击切换所有 Tab 标题的垂直偏移，当前：{titleOffset}",
   "Tap to switch, then tap any tab or the PlusButton to hear it. Haptics vibrate on a real device only. Now: {tapSound}": "点击切换，然后点击任意 Tab 或 PlusButton 试听。触感反馈只在真机上振动。当前：{tapSound}",
   "Tap to switch. cyl_tabBarItemLongPressDuration: {longPress} s, cyl_tabButtonLongPressMinimumDuration: {longPress} s, cyl_tabBarItemDoubleTapInterval: {doubleTap} s": "点击切换。cyl_tabBarItemLongPressDuration：{longPress} 秒，cyl_tabButtonLongPressMinimumDuration：{longPress} 秒，cyl_tabBarItemDoubleTapInterval：{doubleTap} 秒",
   "The image on the left is read from the resource bundle with CYLImageInBundle (not cached). CYLBundleImage in the main bundle: {bundleImage}": "左侧图片由 CYLImageInBundle 从资源包读取（不缓存）。主 bundle 中的 CYLBundleImage：{bundleImage}",
   "The switch sets cyl_automaticNavigationSettingEnabled; tap the row to push a plain UIViewController that sets cyl_navigationBarHidden and cyl_hidesAncestorNavigationBars.": "打开开关即设置 cyl_automaticNavigationSettingEnabled；点击该行 push 一个普通 UIViewController，它设置了 cyl_navigationBarHidden 与 cyl_hidesAncestorNavigationBars。",
   "Title offset (titlePositionAdjustment)": "标题偏移（titlePositionAdjustment）",
   "Turn the switch on to show the touchable area in translucent red, off to restore the normal look; drag the slider to multiply the area. Now: {touchScale}x": "打开开关以半透明红色显示可点击区域，关闭恢复正常；拖动滑块按倍数扩大点击范围，当前：{touchScale} 倍",
   "Turn the switch on, then long-press any tab or the PlusButton to see its identifier.": "打开开关后长按任意 Tab 或加号按钮，会弹出该按钮的标识。",
   "Turn the switch on, then swipe left or right on the page to go to the next or previous tab.": "打开开关后在页面上左右滑动，切换到下一个或上一个 Tab。",
   "Unloads unselected tabs; they load again when selected": "卸载未选中的 Tab，切换时重新加载",
   "Update tabs in place": "原地更新 Tab",
   "Updates the icons of all tabs with local images (name, file path, UIImage, file URL); tap again to restore": "用本地图片（图片名、文件路径、UIImage、文件 URL）更新所有 Tab 的图标，再点恢复",
   "Updates the titles of all tabs at once; tap again to restore": "一次更新所有 Tab 的标题，再点恢复",
